---
source: crates/efr-cli/src/follow/view/tests/left.rs
expression: "shots.join(\"\\n\")"
---
[ended] rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack ended in the hidden shell with exit 23
[stopped] rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack stopped in the hidden shell
[limit] efr stopped rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack in the hidden shell: nobody answered its input in time
[closed] the hidden shell closed with rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack in it; the next call starts a new shell
[shell_exited] the hidden shell exited with rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack in it
[moved] rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack moved to a background job
[unknown] rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack no longer runs in the hidden shell
[teleported] rsync -a -e 'ssh -o PreferredAuthentications=password' u@h:.config/Slack ./slack no longer runs in the hidden shell
